    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1401">

                <pb facs="1087" n="971" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg971"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.512/635.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Silliman
                        to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-05-10">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 10, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s April 26. Governor of Oaxaca informs Foreign Office that he has no
                    information in the matter. Foreign Office requests particulars.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Silliman.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
